---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CallToAction from '@/components/CallToAction.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Wholesale Food Supply Services | Van Harvest Charlotte" description="Explore Van Harvest wholesale supply capabilities, including food catalog support, product sourcing conversations and department-specific customer service." active="/services">
  <section class="inner-hero"><div class="shell inner-grid"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">How we support kitchens</p><h1>Supply support<br />with <em>less friction.</em></h1></div><div class="inner-copy reveal"><p>Our role is straightforward: make a broad assortment easier to navigate and give foodservice teams a clear path to the right products and people.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products">Browse the catalog →</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="services-list">
    <article class="service-block"><div class="service-visual"><span class="service-number">01</span><p>Proteins · Produce · Seafood · Pantry</p></div><div class="service-content reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Wholesale assortment</span><h2>One catalog for the<br /><em>kitchen and beyond.</em></h2><p>Van Harvest's catalog spans core food categories and the operational essentials that keep a foodservice environment ready.</p><div class="service-points"><span>Fresh & frozen proteins</span><span>Produce & fruit</span><span>Seafood assortment</span><span>Pantry ingredients</span></div></div></article>
    <article class="service-block"><div class="service-visual is-produce"><span class="service-number">02</span><p>Item number · Code · Product name</p></div><div class="service-content reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Catalog navigation</span><h2>Find products<br /><em>the way you work.</em></h2><p>Search by item number, supplier code or familiar product wording. Category filters turn a large item list into a focused purchasing view.</p><div class="service-points"><span>Fast keyword search</span><span>Nine departments</span><span>Downloadable PDF</span><span>Clear item references</span></div></div></article>
    <article class="service-block"><div class="service-visual is-gold"><span class="service-number">03</span><p>Sales · Service · Purchasing · Careers</p></div><div class="service-content reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Department access</span><h2>A clear path to<br /><em>the right conversation.</em></h2><p>Sales, customer service, purchasing and human resources each have a dedicated contact path. Department emails will be activated when confirmed.</p><div class="service-points"><span>Sales inquiries</span><span>Customer service</span><span>Supplier conversations</span><span>Career inquiries</span></div></div></article>
  </section>
  <CallToAction />
</BaseLayout>
